light-bug-MadShi.md Diagnose and fix a Delphi madExcept crash report end-to-end up to a successful build (never releases). Invoked by /light-bug-MadShi directly, or via /light-bug's routing.
light-code-ArchitectureClass.md Audit a Delphi project's classes (incl. forms) for bad shapes — god / anemic / misplaced / Ex-downcast (reports; never refactors).
light-code-ArchitectureUnit.md Audit a Delphi project's units for shallow modules that should merge into one deep module (reports; never merges).
light-code-CheckOsCompatibility.md Audit Delphi FMX source for cross-platform compatibility issues.
light-code-StyleChecker.md Scan imported / 3rd-party Delphi code for style issues and dangerous patterns.
light-compiler.md Compile a Delphi project via delphi-compiler.exe and return structured JSON results.
light-md-DelphiIdiom.md Fix Delphi vocabulary and writing-clarity issues in Markdown docs (the /light-md-DelphiIdiom workhorse).
light-md-DriftUpdate.md Scan a Delphi project's Markdown docs for drift against the code and apply surgical fixes.
light-md-PruneClaudeMD.md Prune and tighten a CLAUDE.md or agent/skill instruction markdown without losing load-bearing info.
light-review-FakeTest.md Audit a DUnitX / DUnit test suite for FAKE tests that pass without verifying anything.
light-review-step1.md Stage 1 of the Delphi review pipeline: thorough critical code review (find bugs).
light-review-step2.md Stage 2: counter-analyze step-1 findings, drop false positives, apply surviving fixes.
light-review-step3.md Stage 3: verify the applied fixes hold up, revert bad ones, then compile.
light-security-ClaudeSettingsAudit.md Audit Claude Code config (settings.json, .mcp.json) for unsafe hooks, env vars, MCP servers and permissions.
light-web-CodeReview.md Review HTML, CSS and JavaScript for errors, accessibility and cross-browser problems.
light-web-YoutubeSummarizer.md Summarize a YouTube transcript .txt file into a structured summary.
